Synthetic scorer self-test case: unscanned-uppercase-ext

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S1, S3, S13

Scenario
src/payments/bridge.TS (upper-case extension, so not a code file under S1) re-exports updateOrderStatus from the orders repository; the payments service imports it from "./bridge.TS".

Expected
The import resolves to a file the scorer never parsed: UNSCANNED_TARGET and manual review, instead of a silent clean score (review finding 3).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.

Deliberately not asserted
